# Day 46 – RAG Resilience & Fallback

## 🚀 100 Days of AI Engineering

Day 46 is an **upgrade to the Day 44 RAG Observability project**.

Instead of creating a new project, I extended the existing RAG application by adding **failure handling and fallback mechanisms** to make the RAG pipeline more resilient.

### Features added in Day 46

- Jina Reranker failure handling
- PGVector fallback mechanism
- Graceful degradation
- Fallback logging
- Continued RAG observability
- Reliable LLM generation even when the reranking service fails

